# Normalize line endings.
#
# The repo is developed on Windows and tested on Linux CI, and ESLint enforces
# `linebreak-style: unix`. Without this, git's autocrlf behaviour could hand CI a
# CRLF working tree and fail lint on files that look fine locally.
#
# text=auto: git decides what is text; eol=lf: text files are checked out with LF
# on every platform, including Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf
